TeamTaskManager — Project Flow + Requirements Check
Generated: 24 May 2026 (IST)

1) Project Flow (End-to-End)

A. Signup/Login
1.	User Signup: Name, Email, Password
	API: POST /api/auth/register
	Output: JWT token + user object

2.	User Login: Email, Password
	API: POST /api/auth/login
	Output: JWT token + user object

3.	Fetch Authenticated User
	API: GET /api/auth/me
	Header: Authorization: Bearer <token>

B. Create Project (Creator Becomes Admin)
1.	Logged-in user creates project
	API: POST /api/projects
	Token required

	Behavior:
	- project.admin = creator userId
	- project.members automatically includes creator userId

2.	Members can view assigned projects
	API: GET /api/projects
	Returns only projects where current user is a member

C. Member Management (Admin Only)
1.	Admin adds member by email
	API: PUT /api/projects/:id/add-member
	Body: { email }

	Rules:
	- Only admin can add members
	- User must exist
	- Same member cannot be added twice

2.	Admin removes member by userId
	API: PUT /api/projects/:id/remove-member
	Body: { userId }

	Rules:
	- Only admin can remove members

D. Task Management (Role-Based)

Admin
1.	Create Task
	API: POST /api/tasks
	Fields: title, description, dueDate, priority, assignedTo, projectId

	Rules:
	- Requester must belong to project
	- Only admin can create tasks
	- assignedTo user must belong to same project

2.	Update Task
	API: PUT /api/tasks/:id
	Admin can update any task in project

3.	Update Task Status
	API: PUT /api/tasks/:id/status
	Statuses: To Do, In Progress, Done

4.	Delete Task
	API: DELETE /api/tasks/:id
	Only admin can delete tasks

Member
1.	View Assigned Tasks
	API: GET /api/tasks/project/:projectId
	Members see only assigned tasks

2.	Update Assigned Task
	APIs:
	- PUT /api/tasks/:id
	- PUT /api/tasks/:id/status

	Rules:
	- Allowed only if task is assigned to current member

3.	Restrictions
	- Members cannot create tasks
	- Members cannot delete tasks

E. Dashboard
1.	API: GET /api/dashboard
	Token required

2.	Dashboard Metrics:
	- Total Tasks
	- Tasks by Status
	- Tasks per User
	- Overdue Tasks

3.	Dashboard Rules:
	- Admin sees all project tasks
	- Members see only assigned tasks

