	Member permissions: YES

3) Backend  Database Requirements
	REST APIs: YES
	MongoDB + Mongoose: YES
	Relationships (Users, Projects, Tasks): YES
	Validations and Error Handling: PARTIAL

Recommended Improvements
	- Centralized validation middleware
	- Better error handling
	- Consistent API responses

4) Role Testing
1.	Create User A and login
2.	User A creates project and becomes Admin
3.	Create User B and login
4.	User A adds User B to project
5.	User A assigns tasks to User B
6.	User B should only see assigned tasks
7.	User B should receive 403 on unauthorized actions
